OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after M6 crash
OL,4,Akilled BA hopeful
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver who crashed into a
OL,7,Fstationary car on the M6, killing a
OL,8,F19-year-old woman who was about to
OL,9,Fstart her "dream career" with British
OL,10,FAirways, has been jailed for eight
OL,11,Fyears and four months.
OL,13,FDaniel Barlow, 30, of Dall Street,
OL,14,FBurnley, was sentenced at Chester Crown
OL,15,FCourt after being convicted of causing
OL,16,FChloe Williams' death by dangerous
OL,17,Fdriving and seriously injuring two
OL,18,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
