OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after M6 crash
OL,4,Akilled BA hopeful
OL,5,
OL,6,FChloe was travelling to a concert in
OL,7,FManchester with her partner and a
OL,8,Ffriend when the crash happened near
OL,9,Fjunction 17 for Sandbach on 2 December
OL,10,F2022.
OL,12,FTraffic had stopped due to congestion
OL,13,Fwhen Barlow's HGV crashed into the rear
OL,14,Fof the Volkswagen Polo carrying the
OL,15,Fthree friends, Cheshire Police said.
